  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e71c31d97372da586c3b3ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "研究可没有尽头哦，豚鼠君！",
      "source_fingerprint": "535a4e49c8914b81615f3bc3123f7bea74da5486bc441ea069d3dbc5d6c2bf1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:268ee1eca63f1e5dcc890c85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "始めよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a91c3a42bee3b610a977d9d276cc865eacf6a6007436b210196e4495453836d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df90828cbe58fb845142afc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个结果，看来实验成功了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8855932f28736b5c64983d04bbe3f159bd8065a1d4cdd572aa478836edc897c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:788f7bcb3fd7bf8ffb09044e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得到有意思的数据了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15388bfedd93ddd86c9435336badd8164bddc474205714e1a16f525aaac6b5bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92aeffdb9673f431623d805d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，很有趣的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b40e0e100e9d0530c7594eb131bedb850377cfc125caccb49e08eb76ce768f6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc567971792849e8f0d54bed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还需要再进行些研究。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e2d0b4c7372649bfdef46b57bad3e37f3e2025bec51cbd61a4f4d2eb7aa828c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e4b0e98f96c70688791d7a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "桀桀…这就是研究的成果啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae8c86536ebc80d85ef92175c824f36014968d3a2609a9f8463bbb9b7e1e0e3b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d830a84dd07c5ea0f69d0810",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，验证完毕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "494c215b2dfd1fdeee83fbf95a5f0cd40e0aa466f57445fd913de8207310b0ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c635b369f220d6052e81695",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……这段时光很有意义！",
      "source_fingerprint": "731a77f0bdf981def5e9190916418e65fe454dfad2e26a85b5c0f64301f12a7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e737d48fdadd4bc0cdf4c76e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼，验证完成了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b02135f273ee91d848be509bc693dae29663ff789aa25a0fc17cc6b9a785529d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a51fac880515b38cec0613c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これが可能性…いいものだねぇ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "784c358796290a67be8cc60c7b3283c3f9897e8c68587cf86a048724fa204a3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "30206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d5ecf7832b1b4c87edc68f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふぅっ、検証完了だ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "734e206c400a2d1c29a95977268004d318ef61778833ad7fc7d8efe381cb5bee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "30207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7683bf16ef75b3e68c287e79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去参赛吧…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a257aff91105cc6f39bc5cd90a2c4d1d724acbe2e5eb5eceae4394548f2bb8ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39ae62aa781a3709d1af0487",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，将那可能性推导出来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "011bf4ec47c825598f3977314fb814aa8e75f0e59e18c8cf03320c05d64ed5fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d75fc0825d2c2011e81b4148",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "经过长期的团体集训活动后，\r\n赛马娘的身心会有什么的变化呢？\r\n──哎呀，真叫人期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b65d98ec97cddbdbf1242a6073faea9f101d734935f03f58159d2e0b20a803bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d03f7e427922b75c40c8240",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵。卖人情给学生会……\r\n喔，糟糕。\r\n我得努力让自己能够帮上忙才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff99baa1f13a9ecfa3f6fca636ed5b8c5f90d65dd43b99c61c05916a67ed5ec8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80497319deb1ff060df04e01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，得到了不错的数据！\r\n不只是赛马娘的各种身心变化……\r\n我自己的改变也让人很有兴趣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbd37f9c86b87d4eac9168789fc084aa926c878f1acfa87af6a7254a9f32445c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bfef5b7aa84c5e84a8c08ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，将那可能性推导出来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "011bf4ec47c825598f3977314fb814aa8e75f0e59e18c8cf03320c05d64ed5fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea1f7d67b0bbbfb02ae6264f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ac748b29d0bf3eb338445183a7f076265274a1978807e7baa4ec4b888a6a89d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "40002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3098266477b1c58f245c149",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是革命性的化学反应！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f299a9e57417aa9e81d75afbe6fce42f721a02fd44c42cef6a7eb3f2940b92c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bdfc31077e776b2c907fac7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，现在开始才是重头戏……\r\n哈哈哈哈！要上啰，小奇！\r\n来，让我们好好享受一番吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73d1b5dd507da7c4594cd430616ceacc03e2266cb2ee05a75c69b7b12974f4de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:382ad75038fa5dbfa3a7948b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これが…私の可能性…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1677855839bead6b6b6af04f33aeea6d6ee320c5def7c6985a95924c258117f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "40203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0c8983ee70b723ab68b8419",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "限りなくゼロでも…ゼロではない！\r\n見つけてしまった可能性…限界の先へ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf8e15b524da8edcadde454d809c2ba47f7f83aec4549c95fb0c5d64de8be107",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "40204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8c84d5340db9efb3fc93460",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "彼此都能得到有价值的东西就好了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3f0d6b1f74083c0320d10d60a90a5186476d3bef8d97cf5d20932fe3e7aaa15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4170d51b68774c2b3b07469",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "难得的LIVE…可不能错过哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bf48378d8d33a6864335856bea68e8e5f2268198322867d29ccbfc3a7658540",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b899b69de8ed0d8aa2087f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你也想见证可能性的话，就来帮忙吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b193abba5e17b9beb58df97c05d734fc941fe0715c40cd515e3660d52d721ff9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6f624f0e6105649211778b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我本以为你只是一只\r\n豚鼠而已…现在看来\r\n似乎不是那样呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "911b1992b995deb14c8df37901f3837375f883ffbb7cfb1c48f42b1d5381a256",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c35eb48d263034b626ace2be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然没什么特别之处，但穿起来感觉不错哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b06bb4993a67ee10ade750f4a425281d68bcb040ab2f8c7bac3f9f6a2f2549f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1db2040f75071d01923a1151",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各方面制作起来都很容易的服装，\r\n但它能承受住剧烈运动吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b31b1d011719fc36f8a42534ebb360b2aa9fc2c102bdc69ba97ae47cf0a82d95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5217be3d97ebb2a794f8fdb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服怎么样\r\n是不是正合适？",
      "source_fingerprint": "955e13562088bd8aabb88344539bf36d560c16a91021827496a2510ed1c73613",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d546d4f0b5112c4ab7a02f8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服，在实验时\r\n弄坏了好几次呢…",
      "source_fingerprint": "3571f0d1b1de26cc59bd788f76aa816c5972daf22c73060c8aa41001218a53e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4df0e44e39fc0195fd62c76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这应该是世人眼中很可爱的一种服装吧，\r\n但说实话我不太能理解呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b374a12cf33110f6c18a05b179202e85f93fe082490391db5e9684dc20cf995",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72ca39db40c650ba86670a9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，穿上这套衣服，研究意愿就涌出来了！\r\n我可以做实验吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "088916a1719b597bb4cf7563e11f89559a0b9809dfa43d1cd0ddcc562d4e19ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c903a20ac94165da4ea84443",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你很好奇我的包包装了什么吗？\r\n呵呵，不告诉你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db7dac3e7ba2889cbf5e6a9b2b4c4538481b2f8b96c6d6c870549561262c12a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2f7939bbe466ac0c5119d36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能不能再多增加几支试管呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa2735fd8712ae680c5f04710d862035d5a94fc72372db8ac9844a16ce36a194",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:269e081e8c3bd3f9f1a29c0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a977ca8e3137e67a7a6918a06d3d86d57fbf577994f726c5155115e0a2b3071a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8acff465bd4236c71bd6a0fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧，向着那可能性的尽头……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "021c7308c082875485a9ba0a15577918a1e6ca33d79205d025fbfc5101a94246",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:149db17ca737e121732c1c9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总之，我穿上了手边的衣服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b8dadbcbce9ddc368960f2b1e94e649dd9fb718967553a40035ed59e4fca32f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be9735f665947aa79f29dd5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "洗衣服的事不用担心。\r\n业者会处理。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5eee6073e556eefda35c9df1439abef9305e4471ee02c98f9dba96fb55a6607",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42ec1b2b8d47b5a3f9fd17f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ククッ、私が考え抜いたデザイン…\r\n早く実証実験に及びたいねぇ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "437f0405bb4df403161cf35285cdb345279d3107da6db2c864959b837afd08de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beb3ee6ba56317212fd7616c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ああ、リボンの色はね…\r\n研究対象を識別するための比較表だよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "407d5383a2a086ea6a341f1ab2d4632122defdb580f64c2afa89b7ef920513ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "70217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93ede05d4809367c53948e66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然没什么特别之处，但穿起来感觉不错哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b06bb4993a67ee10ade750f4a425281d68bcb040ab2f8c7bac3f9f6a2f2549f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
