      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:543aa219ec1b31976198d21e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这应该是世人眼中很可爱的一种服装吧，\r\n但说实话我不太能理解呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b374a12cf33110f6c18a05b179202e85f93fe082490391db5e9684dc20cf995",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb45fb58a742850d602a01e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，穿上这套衣服，研究意愿就涌出来了！\r\n我可以做实验吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "088916a1719b597bb4cf7563e11f89559a0b9809dfa43d1cd0ddcc562d4e19ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0aed69b7e8f8ab57fd7bc2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你很好奇我的包包装了什么吗？\r\n呵呵，不告诉你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db7dac3e7ba2889cbf5e6a9b2b4c4538481b2f8b96c6d6c870549561262c12a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:476a5ef66f45a3be07a1a0e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能不能再多增加几支试管呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa2735fd8712ae680c5f04710d862035d5a94fc72372db8ac9844a16ce36a194",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:383a9502358a9692048153ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a977ca8e3137e67a7a6918a06d3d86d57fbf577994f726c5155115e0a2b3071a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00f4fed08b261926b5c71b0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧，向着那可能性的尽头……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "021c7308c082875485a9ba0a15577918a1e6ca33d79205d025fbfc5101a94246",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0872bee05c64cec9eefc24db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ククッ、私が考え抜いたデザイン…\r\n早く実証実験に及びたいねぇ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "437f0405bb4df403161cf35285cdb345279d3107da6db2c864959b837afd08de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "71216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66a2eb5930cb2f0e4469544a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ああ、リボンの色はね…\r\n研究対象を識別するための比較表だよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "407d5383a2a086ea6a341f1ab2d4632122defdb580f64c2afa89b7ef920513ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "71217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cc0db719c287cec19ac484e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お疲れ様",
      "source_fingerprint": "b953841c6237f6f93550f5268f577fd573201293558ed014b9eb53c636e0c0c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:343d3b4db2b93210cbf9b8cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要让我看看你作为实验体\r\n的价值哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2e4261fba70fbfff8e619c226113aca5744fadd99291ce49fd97589752bf95b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e3aa604a8dae1da3e0b40a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "桀桀，\r\n调查得还远远不够呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e95527aba0b2da8b23e8051b9627ec3ccc7f31fb45eae33e27d8b091c3553671",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a114af1c40b401fbdf130376",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好，训练员君。\r\n来，把胳膊伸出来。\r\n今天从验血开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0066c2fd8b86cfcde7f852f42b45463f02976ab52a61493aac824329b5ab4e96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a0bbfc41d218c6eea80ba82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀哎呀，你总算来了！\r\n那咱们马上开始实验吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de732f7630bb659085dc8ea478656fba0a439b4ab594f53ecbbdc1edaef52e69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "900000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8171ed2b876332223ea8d941",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太棒了！这回\r\n得到了充足的研究成果哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a24819ec1f73e84c8b89cfd74e7823e794269ed3e4ad84ade41faf85883e463f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "900001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d1ee07445739e23c2a99932",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "度过了一段很有意义的时光。\r\n下回再来找你帮忙哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac00fd5910df8e8e85cdb4583bb48028bdd401c6fcaa76017b0d1992d52f86ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "900002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4430aee8c9d5455a2f4b989c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "研究报告，\r\n派得上用场吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "08eee820e8197ff26481ae3269307095d41e35da67a75813e82f108be82e5769",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "900003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cacf302ed10f193fae2f232",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さぁ、研究を始めようじゃないか！\r\n有望な助手との共同研究…予想外の\r\n化学反応を期待してしまうねえ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "19bedfd47b4e4ea65c9d702f396513ab4ddd1f81b2be6367ef39d4c46c02db8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "900004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f6f3bf5c634fdf5697db464",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "協力ご苦労。今回も興味深い\r\n結果を得られた！さっそく\r\n次なる研究に取りかかるとしよう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b6e07f426e86846ac3951c963b62d90281312d35570fcd895178918cea91915",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "900005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30acd4177c0d20d025972e94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この結果はすべて私の個人的な\r\n研究に使わせてもらうとするよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1d578cda5e46fb5999d79966459dbca6727bff51acba4877c2b95aacc6a538a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "900006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfdb7379aa63316bc2127ed1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "研究レポート…使ったらどうだい？\r\nさぁさ、結果をみせておくれよ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d143f33334ee9edc5348dd881cefd7f7a9c9a8455e6c8ec5c253702f450abe90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "900007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:594137578770b6bc53fa8909",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "リスクは重々承知してるとも！\r\nそのうえで…是非！被検体に！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69f5d80e5c0f57d263473afbc36ac2d36c9026f0d968d2784345a2a56fe2785e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "900008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae469a489a9ed1079ae25d6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "未知の可能性を追い求めたくなる…\r\n科学者としての性というところさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59386aa6b3103f927590db3eda053fde24eaf5d040596bcb00420d6a8931c6e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "900009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2b5f4aa11acef8a7f26a631",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊～啊…我在做的研究\r\n有了些进展呢。回过神来\r\n就已经是早上了…呼啊啊啊…",
      "source_fingerprint": "f72f7930e8bf4ed2cd028b1ae462472ef4f8a74325a8c17d66ca54b824a0207b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbb80648e9b991fe9eea95a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我下午想开展新的实验来着，\r\n在那之前可否请你\r\n去跑个10km呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "68600a35c9a960a4d02c51cc44ad335c3ed44436c3ccb2da6fde41b6e300f8d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:326bf057e27040c784cf1e54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃完午饭了吗？\r\n我给你准备一杯饭后茶吧。\r\n放心，味道很普通的。只是味道哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82b0221f9953586239c08e0dd6618f2344167d57d9216e255f3a3e99d99cbedb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9ef3b0eb8344d2f1b2c86fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "睡不着觉的话，我给你准备了\r\n自己珍藏的药哦。虽然代价是会做恶梦，\r\n不过也没什么问题！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89e7ee9ec37b53078057d3fc31e0cccef4bd65305cf293d3b60a8f575e58a5e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f85cf004b29bb334d619cefd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "都到晚上了也没见训练员君的\r\n肌肉有什么变化…早上掺的药失败了吗。\r\n哎呀，遗憾遗憾！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53541cdca6c7763493b5f0a79d9e35881b2562e7157ae7d91416579e931d2a16",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d264030fb163229b9dc83ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到那些纯真的马娘，我心里可激动了。\r\n有没有适合当作实验体的孩子呢～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5449a4cfcb380f17613ceb6427cebb1f65586547070ad3290d9b91dc93785a50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d7b1d2054abb961431866c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我尊敬的人很多，\r\n但对发明空调的人，\r\n我每年都想给他写感谢信呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1ec87a9c77a89e41bd3a86c8836b08e77339e40267b1ad28f5b980cbd971862",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a651e99b9db966e5322ce50c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "实验之秋呢…桀桀。\r\n…哦呀？你刚才吓了一跳吗？\r\n是痉挛了吗。好，我来给你检查一下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4fb31e0630b0a11f7a87a6756dd53c966343099b6d072996c696d47ebeb0c35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbb122d19d60d038c3226b6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我给你试做了一份感冒预防药。\r\n放心喝下去吧。\r\n身体发光的话就说明起作用了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36837dafd5d4412ba3cc7efaf91681c6c8d0473e999c165745975b9e4e46d2e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2bca8d8b47602355163943d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安，训练员。\r\n你有确实做好热身运动了吗？\r\n问我为什么……你应该明白吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "806dfd4bea27fda996866ef41728655259d4576f315214e80880837e2d77cb00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c015f8de046bacff6a0db06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "劝你不要在整晚没睡后的早晨泡澡，\r\n因为会溺水的，就像我一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e895a14f24e947eeaf6d3e4c902ad9f9a57468b122dc7de7ff09dbc5d011d33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01154e3b8ae81e0c07c669e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "仔细看我扁扁的肚子吧。\r\n再这样下去我会饿倒在路边的。\r\n放心啦，吃海鲜料理我也接受！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b464560cf741fd30e9840008933dc0b995b4f4459afdf04c847764ac36b5588",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:364855a4f140f1985bc648ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下午到海边做实验吧。\r\n我想拿你调查沙浴的效果。\r\n别担心，我会确实把你埋下去的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eff99c4741d9a09660128ebf6ef35b9c569cb6ddf100f6bf46200a7e3d49c2c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "90013"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
